
### 1. Successful payment lookup — expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1001
Accept: application/json


### 2. Payment not found — expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/9999
Accept: application/json

### 3. Duplicate payment — expect 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1001
Accept: application/json

### 4. Unexpected exception — expect 500
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/test-error
Accept: application/json
